{
  "workflowId": "300000331062509",
  "workflowCode": "ORA_LEARNING_KNOWLEDGE_INDEX_GENERATOR",
  "name": "Learning Knowledge Index Generator",
  "description": "This workflow agent performs file-level processing for learning content, handling both single-file items and individual files within SCORM packages. Based on the requested operation (INDEX or DELETE) and content format, it invokes the appropriate REST APIs to extract content, generate refined semantic sections, persist structured metadata, and vectorize the results for semantic search and RAG. The agent also supports targeted cleanup by deleting persisted sections and vector embeddings for a specific file when requested.",
